or the year ended December 31, 2025 were not material. Acquisition-related expenses totaled $4.0 million for the year ended December 31, 2025 and are included in selling, general and administrative expenses.\nThe following unaudited pro forma financial information presents the combined results of operations for Aero 3 and VSE Corporation for the years ended December 31, 2025, and 2024, respectively. The unaudited consolidated pro forma results of operations are as follows (in thousands):\nFor the years ended December 31,\n2025 2024\nRevenue $ 1,222,244 $ 901,940\nIncome from continuing operations $ 66,489 $ 29,217\n"}
